    "findings": [
      "Reviewed all seven formal pages and the exact one-trait/one-binding mapping: the only binding is forcestaff_p1_m1, rendered as 虛空爆破力場法杖 陰陽 Mk III; the blessing map and force-staff reverse index agree.",
      "The I–IV full-charge requests are 2/4/6/8 layers, rounded after charge scaling; each layer adds 2.5 percentage points of target Brittleness, with the shared rending_debuff capped at 16 layers for 5 seconds. The bilingual RAW strings, hashes, and all four static formatter reconstructions are consistent.",
      "The primary projectile uses force_staff_ball; its impact profile has no speed_to_charge_settings, so the earlier nil-to-1 fallback remains impact charge 1. The profile has no skip_on_hit_proc, and force_staff_single_target is not in Attack’s no-proc table. The queued-event caveat remains explicitly static and conditional on the live action/item/held gates.",
      "The complete proof covers action_stab, action_stab_heavy, action_swipe, and action_swipe_heavy; each has no use_charge and uses charge 1, with three actual profiles/overrides lacking skip_on_hit_proc. Push nil maps to zero and neither adds a layer nor refreshes the timer.",
      "The target-stat cache caveat is accurate: new stacks become visible after target-stat recomputation; no same-hit or immediately-next-event guarantee is made. Positive requests at the 16-layer cap refresh the shared 5-second expiry without adding layers; zero requests do not refresh; owner switching gates new events but does not clear an existing target debuff.",
      "Both armor examples match the armor-aware formula and clearly state their controlled assumptions: 30 to 40 (33.33% relative gain) at A=.30/r=.10, and 90 to 107.5 (19.44% relative gain) at A=.90/r=.40/o=.25. They distinguish Brittleness percentage points from final damage and do not claim weapon damage measurements.",
      "The icon path, icon identifier, and Issue attachment URL are separate and match the verified image receipt. All 36 scope file hashes match; canonical config equals extension-draft.configuration and the focused source/link/GFM check receipt passes."
    ],
